-- title:
--   Lemma pauliX_entry of the MIP* = RE formalization
-- statement:
--   A statement of the module `MIPRE.Foundations.Introspection.HonestXCoordinates` of the MIP\* = RE formalization (commit `70cbf1c` of vidick/MIPRE-formalization). Pauli-X projectors under the honest register split. The stopping measurement in Hide uses the X basis of the active register. These identities expose its tensor factors in the coordinate split used by the adaptive CL recursion.
--
